  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.18 Person with a disability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.18 “Person with a disability” means a person who by reason of a physical defect or infirmity permanently requires the use of special aids to enable the person to propel herself or himself.\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 401.17)",
